                    "text": [
                      "This is the inside\nof the commemorative\ntantalum metal plate@",
                      "on the Europa Clipper.\nIt features an \nengraved poem by  @",
                      "U.S. Poet Laureate \nAda Limón.\nRead poem?"
                    ],
                    "__section": "text",
