                    },
                    "__collapseElse": true
                  },
                  "children": {
                    "true": [
                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "\"In Praise of Mystery: \nA Poem for Europa\"  @"
                          ],
                          "__section": "text",
                          "avatarId": "",
                          "minHeight": 4,
                          "maxHeight": 7,
                          "textX": 1,
                          "textY": 1,
                          "textHeight": 5,
                          "position": "bottom",
                          "clearPrevious": true,
                          "showFrame": "true",
                          "speedIn": -1,
                          "speedOut": -1,
                          "closeWhen": "key",
                          "closeButton": "a",
                          "closeDelayTime": 0.5,
                          "closeDelayFrames": 30
                        },
                        "id": "68744987-b59a-4f66-81f2-d7ced8e6446c"
                      },
                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "Arching under the \nnight sky inky\nwith black expansive-\nness, we point to the \nplanets we know, we  @"
                          ],
                          "__section": "text",
                          "avatarId": "",
                          "minHeight": 7,
                          "maxHeight": 11,
                          "textX": 1,
                          "textY": 1,
                          "textHeight": 5,
                          "position": "bottom",
                          "clearPrevious": true,
                          "showFrame": "true",
                          "speedIn": -1,
                          "speedOut": -1,
                          "closeWhen": "key",
                          "closeButton": "a",
                          "closeDelayTime": 0.5,
                          "closeDelayFrames": 30
                        },
                        "id": "5d2c2aa1-a39f-4085-b5be-b932bfd23e23"
                      },
                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "pin quick wishes on \nstars. From earth,\nwe read the sky as if \nit is an unerring book\nof the universe, \nexpert and evident.  @"
                          ],
                          "__section": "text",
                          "avatarId": "",
                          "minHeight": 8,
                          "maxHeight": 14,
                          "textX": 1,
                          "textY": 1,
                          "textHeight": 6,
                          "position": "bottom",
                          "clearPrevious": true,
                          "showFrame": "true",
                          "speedIn": -1,
                          "speedOut": -1,
                          "closeWhen": "key",
                          "closeButton": "a",
                          "closeDelayTime": 0.5,
                          "closeDelayFrames": 30
                        },
                        "id": "a2c93575-dca8-420b-9e26-42553559c82c"
                      },
                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "Still, there are \nmysteries below our \nsky: the whale song, \nthe songbird singing\nits call in the bough \nof a wind-shaken \ntree.  @"
                          ],
                          "__section": "text",
                          "avatarId": "",
                          "minHeight": 8,
                          "maxHeight": 11,
                          "textX": 1,
                          "textY": 1,
                          "textHeight": 8,
                          "position": "bottom",
                          "clearPrevious": true,
                          "showFrame": "true",
                          "speedIn": -1,
                          "speedOut": -1,
                          "closeWhen": "key",
                          "closeButton": "a",
                          "closeDelayTime": 0.5,
                          "closeDelayFrames": 30
                        },
                        "id": "b9494691-87ff-406f-9fda-48fabf68535f"
                      },
                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "We are creatures of\nconstant awe,\ncurious at beauty, at \nleaf and blossom,\nat grief and \npleasure, sun and \nshadow.  @"
                          ],
                          "__section": "text",
                          "avatarId": "",
                          "minHeight": 8,
                          "maxHeight": 11,
                          "textX": 1,
                          "textY": 1,
                          "textHeight": 8,
                          "position": "bottom",
                          "clearPrevious": true,
                          "showFrame": "true",
                          "speedIn": -1,
                          "speedOut": -1,
                          "closeWhen": "key",
                          "closeButton": "a",
                          "closeDelayTime": 0.5,
                          "closeDelayFrames": 30
                        },
                        "id": "3afe3030-2e47-491a-86b2-0b6fe96973d5"
                      },
                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "And it is not darkness\nthat unites us,\nnot the cold distance \nof space, but\nthe offering of water,\neach drop of rain,  @"
                          ],
                          "__section": "text",
                          "avatarId": "",
                          "minHeight": 8,
                          "maxHeight": 11,
                          "textX": 1,
                          "textY": 1,
                          "textHeight": 8,
                          "position": "bottom",
                          "clearPrevious": true,
                          "showFrame": "true",
                          "speedIn": -1,
                          "speedOut": -1,
                          "closeWhen": "key",
                          "closeButton": "a",
                          "closeDelayTime": 0.5,
                          "closeDelayFrames": 30
                        },
                        "id": "a2923e26-01a8-4ea9-93b2-38937b92dada"
                      },
                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "each rivulet, each\npulse, each vein.\nO second moon, we, \ntoo, are made\nof water, of vast \nand beckoning seas.  @"
                          ],
                          "__section": "text",
                          "avatarId": "",
                          "minHeight": 8,
                          "maxHeight": 11,
                          "textX": 1,
                          "textY": 1,
                          "textHeight": 8,
                          "position": "bottom",
                          "clearPrevious": true,
                          "showFrame": "true",
                          "speedIn": -1,
                          "speedOut": -1,
                          "closeWhen": "key",
                          "closeButton": "a",
                          "closeDelayTime": 0.5,
                          "closeDelayFrames": 30
                        },
                        "id": "a7c0a73e-2565-4524-bfc2-776a5f8d477d"
                      },
                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "We, too, are made \nof wonders, of great\nand ordinary loves, \nof small invisible\nworlds,\nof a need to call \nout through the dark."
                          ],
                          "__section": "text",
                          "avatarId": "",
                          "minHeight": 8,
                          "maxHeight": 11,
                          "textX": 1,
                          "textY": 1,
                          "textHeight": 8,
                          "position": "bottom",
                          "clearPrevious": true,
                          "showFrame": "true",
                          "speedIn": -1,
                          "speedOut": -1,
                          "closeWhen": "key",
                          "closeButton": "a",
                          "closeDelayTime": 0.5,
                          "closeDelayFrames": 30
                        },
                        "id": "3b1878d5-1f29-42fd-85b3-33b40db56a35"
